{"cells":[{"source":"<a href=\"https://www.kaggle.com/code/martareinhardtrs/logiflow?scriptVersionId=318677755\" target=\"_blank\"><img align=\"left\" alt=\"Kaggle\" title=\"Open in Kaggle\" src=\"https://kaggle.com/static/images/open-in-kaggle.svg\"></a>","metadata":{},"cell_type":"markdown"},{"cell_type":"markdown","id":"70a9a87f","metadata":{"papermill":{"duration":0.003565,"end_time":"2026-05-12T12:14:36.207264+00:00","exception":false,"start_time":"2026-05-12T12:14:36.203699+00:00","status":"completed"},"tags":[]},"source":["# 🌿 Logiflow Bridge: AI-Powered Food Rescue\n","**Hackathon: Gemma 4 Challenge**\n","\n","Made in my cell phone(I don't have a computer)\n","Model: Gemma 4 31B-it and Gemma 4 26B A4B-it\n","Google AI Studio\n"," \n","---\n","\n","\n","## 🚀 Live Application\n","Experience the real-time AI intelligence here:\n","👉 [**Launch Logiflow App**]( https://logiflow.streamlit.app/)\n","\n","---\n","\n","## 💡 The Problem & The Solution\n","### The Problem\n","Food waste is a global crisis. Millions of tons of perfectly edible food are discarded daily due to poor inventory management and proximity to expiry dates.\n","\n","### Our Solution\n","**Logiflow Bridge** uses **Gemma 4 Intelligence** to create a circular economy. Our platform:\n","*   **Predicts Waste:** Analyzes inventory patterns to flag items at risk.\n","*   **Dynamic Pricing:** Suggests automatic discounts to ensure food is sold before it expires.\n","*   **Connects Communities:** Bridges the gap between local producers and eco-conscious consumers.\n","\n","---\n","\n","## 🧠 AI Architecture (Powered by Gemma 4)\n","We utilize the **Gemma 4** model to power our \"Intelligence Insights\" engine. The model processes:\n","1.  **Expiry Proximity:** Calculating time-to-waste.\n","2.  **Stock Patterns:** Identifying low-inventory alerts.\n","3.  **Impact Calculation:** Converting rescued food into measurable environmental metrics (kg of waste prevented).\n","\n","---\n","\n","## 🛠️ Tech Stack\n","* **Language:** Python\n","* **Frontend:** Streamlit\n","* **Database:** SQLite (Relational Data Management)\n","* **Deployment:** Streamlit Cloud"]},{"cell_type":"code","execution_count":1,"id":"48035f5d","metadata":{"execution":{"iopub.execute_input":"2026-05-12T12:14:36.214229Z","iopub.status.busy":"2026-05-12T12:14:36.214Z","iopub.status.idle":"2026-05-12T12:14:37.198684Z","shell.execute_reply":"2026-05-12T12:14:37.197981Z"},"papermill":{"duration":0.990465,"end_time":"2026-05-12T12:14:37.200436+00:00","exception":false,"start_time":"2026-05-12T12:14:36.209971+00:00","status":"completed"},"tags":[]},"outputs":[{"data":{"text/markdown":["# 🌿 Logiflow Bridge: Kaggle System Simulation"],"text/plain":["<IPython.core.display.Markdown object>"]},"metadata":{},"output_type":"display_data"},{"data":{"text/markdown":["---"],"text/plain":["<IPython.core.display.Markdown object>"]},"metadata":{},"output_type":"display_data"},{"data":{"text/markdown":["### 🛠️ Step 1: User Authentication"],"text/plain":["<IPython.core.display.Markdown object>"]},"metadata":{},"output_type":"display_data"},{"name":"stdout","output_type":"stream","text":["Simulating login for 'Eco Consumer' (consumer@demo.com)...\n","✅ Login Successful! Welcome, Eco Consumer\n","\n"]},{"data":{"text/markdown":["### 🛒 Step 2: Consumer Marketplace (Search: 'Avocado')"],"text/plain":["<IPython.core.display.Markdown object>"]},"metadata":{},"output_type":"display_data"},{"data":{"text/html":["<div>\n","<style scoped>\n","    .dataframe tbody tr th:only-of-type {\n","        vertical-align: middle;\n","    }\n","\n","    .dataframe tbody tr th {\n","        vertical-align: top;\n","    }\n","\n","    .dataframe thead th {\n","        text-align: right;\n","    }\n","</style>\n","<table border=\"1\" class=\"dataframe\">\n","  <thead>\n","    <tr style=\"text-align: right;\">\n","      <th></th>\n","      <th>name</th>\n","      <th>seller_name</th>\n","      <th>price</th>\n","      <th>expiry_date</th>\n","    </tr>\n","  </thead>\n","  <tbody>\n","    <tr>\n","      <th>0</th>\n","      <td>Fresh Avocado</td>\n","      <td>Green Valley Farms</td>\n","      <td>2.0</td>\n","      <td>2026-05-13</td>\n","    </tr>\n","  </tbody>\n","</table>\n","</div>"],"text/plain":["            name         seller_name  price expiry_date\n","0  Fresh Avocado  Green Valley Farms    2.0  2026-05-13"]},"metadata":{},"output_type":"display_data"},{"name":"stdout","output_type":"stream","text":["\n","💡 Insight: Notice the 'Fresh Avocado' is near expiry. This triggers a 'RESCUE ITEM' alert in our app.\n","\n","\n"]},{"data":{"text/markdown":["### 🏪 Step 3: Seller Dashboard & Gemma 4 Intelligence"],"text/plain":["<IPython.core.display.Markdown object>"]},"metadata":{},"output_type":"display_data"},{"name":"stdout","output_type":"stream","text":["Simulating login for 'Green Valley Farms' (Seller)...\n","✅ Seller Login Successful!\n","\n","📊 Sustainability Metrics:\n","   - Waste Prevented: 1.2 kg\n","   - Platform Status: Gemma 4 Engine Online\n","\n","🤖 Gemma 4 Intelligence Insights (Predictive Analysis):\n","   [!] Fresh Avocado: High waste risk! Suggest 40% discount.\n","\n","📦 Current Inventory:\n"]},{"data":{"text/html":["<div>\n","<style scoped>\n","    .dataframe tbody tr th:only-of-type {\n","        vertical-align: middle;\n","    }\n","\n","    .dataframe tbody tr th {\n","        vertical-align: top;\n","    }\n","\n","    .dataframe thead th {\n","        text-align: right;\n","    }\n","</style>\n","<table border=\"1\" class=\"dataframe\">\n","  <thead>\n","    <tr style=\"text-align: right;\">\n","      <th></th>\n","      <th>name</th>\n","      <th>qty</th>\n","      <th>price</th>\n","      <th>expiry_date</th>\n","      <th>condition</th>\n","    </tr>\n","  </thead>\n","  <tbody>\n","    <tr>\n","      <th>0</th>\n","      <td>Organic Milk</td>\n","      <td>50</td>\n","      <td>3.5</td>\n","      <td>2026-05-27</td>\n","      <td>Fresh</td>\n","    </tr>\n","    <tr>\n","      <th>1</th>\n","      <td>Fresh Avocado</td>\n","      <td>5</td>\n","      <td>2.0</td>\n","      <td>2026-05-13</td>\n","      <td>Ripe</td>\n","    </tr>\n","  </tbody>\n","</table>\n","</div>"],"text/plain":["            name  qty  price expiry_date condition\n","0   Organic Milk   50    3.5  2026-05-27     Fresh\n","1  Fresh Avocado    5    2.0  2026-05-13      Ripe"]},"metadata":{},"output_type":"display_data"},{"data":{"text/markdown":["---"],"text/plain":["<IPython.core.display.Markdown object>"]},"metadata":{},"output_type":"display_data"},{"data":{"text/markdown":["### 🌍 Final Impact Analysis"],"text/plain":["<IPython.core.display.Markdown object>"]},"metadata":{},"output_type":"display_data"},{"data":{"text/markdown":["**System Status: Operational. All food rescue loops are active.**"],"text/plain":["<IPython.core.display.Markdown object>"]},"metadata":{},"output_type":"display_data"}],"source":["# ==============================================================================\n","# 🌿 LOGIFLOW BRIDGE - KAGGLE HACKATHON VERSION (FINAL & STABLE)\n","# ==============================================================================\n","# This version is optimized to run perfectly in Kaggle Notebooks.\n","# It simulates the entire engine without needing a web server.\n","# ==============================================================================\n","\n","import pandas as pd\n","import sqlite3\n","import datetime\n","import random  # \n","from IPython.display import display, Markdown\n","\n","# ==============================================================================\n","# 1. DATABASE ENGINE\n","# ==============================================================================\n","\n","class LogiflowDB:\n","    def __init__(self, db_name=\"logiflow_demo.db\"):\n","        self.db_name = db_name\n","        self._setup_db()\n","\n","    def _get_conn(self):\n","        return sqlite3.connect(self.db_name, check_same_thread=False)\n","\n","    def _setup_db(self):\n","        conn = self._get_conn()\n","        cursor = conn.cursor()\n","        \n","        # Create Tables\n","        cursor.execute('''CREATE TABLE IF NOT EXISTS users (\n","                            user_id INTEGER PRIMARY KEY AUTOINCREMENT,\n","                            name TEXT, email TEXT UNIQUE, password TEXT, \n","                            phone TEXT, address TEXT, is_seller BOOLEAN)''')\n","        \n","        cursor.execute('''CREATE TABLE IF NOT EXISTS products (\n","                            id INTEGER PRIMARY KEY AUTOINCREMENT,\n","                            user_id INTEGER, name TEXT, qty INTEGER, price REAL,\n","                            expiry_date DATE, condition TEXT, is_producer BOOLEAN, address TEXT,\n","                            waste_prevented_kg REAL DEFAULT 0.0,\n","                            FOREIGN KEY(user_id) REFERENCES users(user_id))''')\n","        \n","        cursor.execute('''CREATE TABLE IF NOT EXISTS messages (\n","                            id INTEGER PRIMARY KEY AUTOINCREMENT,\n","                            sender_id INTEGER, receiver_id INTEGER, message TEXT, timestamp TIMESTAMP)''')\n","\n","        # Migration: Check if password column exists\n","        cursor.execute(\"PRAGMA table_info(users)\")\n","        columns = [column[1] for column in cursor.fetchall()]\n","        if 'password' not in columns:\n","            cursor.execute(\"ALTER TABLE users ADD COLUMN password TEXT\")\n","\n","        # Seed initial data\n","        cursor.execute(\"SELECT COUNT(*) FROM users\")\n","        if cursor.fetchone()[0] == 0:\n","            self._seed_data(cursor)\n","\n","        conn.commit() \n","        conn.close()\n","\n","    def _seed_data(self, cursor):\n","        users = [\n","            (\"Green Valley Farms\", \"farm@demo.com\", \"pass123\", \"555-0101\", \"123 Rural Road\", 1),\n","            (\"Urban Market\", \"market@demo.com\", \"pass123\", \"555-0202\", \"45 Main St\", 1),\n","            (\"Eco Consumer\", \"consumer@demo.com\", \"pass123\", \"555-9999\", \"789 Oak Ave\", 0)\n","        ]\n","        cursor.executemany(\"INSERT INTO users (name, email, password, phone, address, is_seller) VALUES (?,?,?,?,?,?)\", users)\n","\n","        today = datetime.date.today()\n","        products = [\n","            (1, \"Organic Milk\", 50, 3.50, (today + datetime.timedelta(days=15)).isoformat(), \"Fresh\", 1, \"Farm Gate\", 0.0),\n","            (1, \"Fresh Avocado\", 5, 2.00, (today + datetime.timedelta(days=1)).isoformat(), \"Ripe\", 1, \"Farm Gate\", 1.2),\n","            (2, \"Sourdough Bread\", 12, 5.00, (today + datetime.timedelta(days=3)).isoformat(), \"Bakery\", 0, \"City Center\", 0.5)\n","        ]\n","        cursor.executemany(\"INSERT INTO products (user_id, name, qty, price, expiry_date, condition, is_producer, address, waste_prevented_kg) VALUES (?,?,?,?,?,?,?,?,?)\", products)\n","\n","    def login_user(self, email, password):\n","        conn = self._get_conn()\n","        sql = \"SELECT * FROM users WHERE email = ? AND password = ?\"\n","        df = pd.read_sql_query(sql, conn, params=(email, password))\n","        conn.close()\n","        return df\n","\n","    def search_products(self, query):\n","        conn = self._get_conn()\n","        sql = \"\"\"SELECT p.*, u.name as seller_name, u.phone as seller_phone, u.user_id as seller_id\n","                 FROM products p JOIN users u ON p.user_id = u.user_id WHERE p.name LIKE ?\"\"\"\n","        df = pd.read_sql_query(sql, conn, params=(f\"%{query}%\",))\n","        conn.close()\n","        return df\n","\n","    def get_user_products(self, user_id):\n","        conn = self._get_conn()\n","        df = pd.read_sql_query(\"SELECT name, qty, price, expiry_date, condition FROM products WHERE user_id = ?\", conn, params=(user_id,))\n","        conn.close()\n","        return df\n","\n","    def get_impact_metrics(self, user_id):\n","        conn = self._get_conn()\n","        df = pd.read_sql_query(\"SELECT SUM(waste_prevented_kg) as total_kg FROM products WHERE user_id = ?\", conn, params=(user_id,))\n","        conn.close()\n","        return df['total_kg'].iloc[0] if not df.empty and df['total_kg'].iloc[0] is not None else 0.0\n","\n","    def get_gemma_insights(self, user_id):\n","        conn = self._get_conn()\n","        cursor = conn.cursor()\n","        cursor.execute(\"SELECT id, name, expiry_date, qty FROM products WHERE user_id = ?\", (user_id,))\n","        rows = cursor.fetchall()\n","        conn.close()\n","        insights = []\n","        today = datetime.date.today()\n","        for r in rows:\n","            pid, name, expiry_str, qty = r[0], r[1], r[2], r[3]\n","            try:\n","                exp = datetime.datetime.strptime(expiry_str, '%Y-%m-%d').date()\n","                if (exp - today).days < 3:\n","                    insights.append({\"id\": pid, \"name\": name, \"type\": \"DISCOUNT\", \"msg\": \"High waste risk! Suggest 40% discount.\"})\n","            except: pass\n","            if qty < 5:\n","                insights.append({\"id\": pid, \"name\": name, \"type\": \"RESTOCK\", \"msg\": \"Low inventory detected. Reorder soon.\"})\n","        return insights\n","\n","# ==============================================================================\n","# 2. SIMULATION ENGINE (FOR KAGGLE PRESENTATION)\n","# ==============================================================================\n","\n","def run_demo():\n","    db = LogiflowDB()\n","    \n","    display(Markdown(\"# 🌿 Logiflow Bridge: Kaggle System Simulation\"))\n","    display(Markdown(\"---\"))\n","\n","    # --- STEP 1: AUTHENTICATION ---\n","    display(Markdown(\"### 🛠️ Step 1: User Authentication\"))\n","    print(\"Simulating login for 'Eco Consumer' (consumer@demo.com)...\")\n","    user_df = db.login_user(\"consumer@demo.com\", \"pass123\")\n","    \n","    if not user_df.empty:\n","        user = user_df.iloc[0].to_dict()\n","        print(f\"✅ Login Successful! Welcome, {user['name']}\\n\")\n","    else:\n","        print(\"❌ Login Failed.\")\n","        return\n","\n","    # --- STEP 2: MARKETPLACE ---\n","    display(Markdown(\"### 🛒 Step 2: Consumer Marketplace (Search: 'Avocado')\"))\n","    results = db.search_products(\"Avocado\")\n","    if not results.empty:\n","        display(results[['name', 'seller_name', 'price', 'expiry_date']])\n","        print(\"\\n💡 Insight: Notice the 'Fresh Avocado' is near expiry. This triggers a 'RESCUE ITEM' alert in our app.\")\n","    else:\n","        print(\"No products found.\")\n","    print(\"\\n\")\n","\n","    # --- STEP 3: SELLER DASHBOARD & AI ---\n","    display(Markdown(\"### 🏪 Step 3: Seller Dashboard & Gemma 4 Intelligence\"))\n","    print(\"Simulating login for 'Green Valley Farms' (Seller)...\")\n","    seller_df = db.login_user(\"farm@demo.com\", \"pass123\")\n","    \n","    if not seller_df.empty:\n","        seller = seller_df.iloc[0].to_dict()\n","        print(f\"✅ Seller Login Successful!\\n\")\n","        \n","        # Metrics\n","        impact = db.get_impact_metrics(seller['user_id'])\n","        print(f\"📊 Sustainability Metrics:\")\n","        print(f\"   - Waste Prevented: {impact} kg\")\n","        print(f\"   - Platform Status: Gemma 4 Engine Online\\n\")\n","        \n","        # AI Insights\n","        print(\"🤖 Gemma 4 Intelligence Insights (Predictive Analysis):\")\n","        insights = db.get_gemma_insights(seller['user_id'])\n","        if not insights:\n","            print(\"   - No urgent actions needed.\")\n","        for i, ins in enumerate(insights):\n","            print(f\"   [!] {ins['name']}: {ins['msg']}\")\n","        \n","        # Inventory\n","        print(\"\\n📦 Current Inventory:\")\n","        display(db.get_user_products(seller['user_id']))\n","    else:\n","        print(\"❌ Seller Login Failed.\")\n","\n","    display(Markdown(\"---\"))\n","    display(Markdown(\"### 🌍 Final Impact Analysis\"))\n","    display(Markdown(\"**System Status: Operational. All food rescue loops are active.**\"))\n","\n","# EXECUTE THE DEMO\n","if __name__ == \"__main__\":\n","    run_demo()"]},{"cell_type":"markdown","id":"419dd58b","metadata":{"papermill":{"duration":0.003684,"end_time":"2026-05-12T12:14:37.207913+00:00","exception":false,"start_time":"2026-05-12T12:14:37.204229+00:00","status":"completed"},"tags":[]},"source":["\n","## ❤️ Connecting Community & Commerce: A Human-Centric Logistics Solution## The Vision: No Item Left Behind\n","Our project uses Gemma to create a \"Digital Bridge\" between local shopkeepers and their neighbors. The goal is simple but profound: to ensure that no product goes to waste while a person nearby is looking for it.\n","## Empowering the Local Hero (The Small Business Owner)\n","Small retailers and local suppliers are the heart of our community. However, they often struggle with:\n","\n","   1. Invisible Stock: Neighbors don't know what's available on their shelves in real-time.\n","   2. Painful Waste: Watching fresh, organic food go to waste is both a financial and emotional burden.\n","   3. Disconnected Tools: They have the products, but no easy way to tell the \"Google world\" exactly what is ready for pick-up now.\n","\n","## How Gemma Facilitates this Human Connection:\n","\n","* A Real-Time Voice for Sellers: Instead of complex systems, sellers can easily report their actual stock. Gemma acts as the \"translator,\" taking that raw info and making it useful for the community.\n","* The \"Proximity Link\": When a user searches for a basic need, Google doesn't just show a link; it shows a local solution. It says: \"Your neighbor at the corner store has this item fresh and ready for you.\"\n","* Social & Environmental Impact: By identifying items nearing their expiration, Gemma suggests community-first actions:\n","* Affordability: Helping low-income families find quality products at a discount.\n","   * Solidarity: Connecting stores directly with local food banks for seamless donations.\n","\n","## Why this Matters:\n","This is not just a logistics app; it's a Sustainability Bridge. It’s about building a world where technology serves the neighborhood, reduces the environmental footprint of waste, and supports the local economy.\n","\n","\"Gemma helps us turn 'inventory data' into 'community support'. It's about making sure the organic juice from a local producer finds its way to a person's table, not a landfill.\"\n","\n","------------------------------\n","\n","\n"]},{"cell_type":"code","execution_count":2,"id":"ee53f7ad","metadata":{"execution":{"iopub.execute_input":"2026-05-12T12:14:37.216537Z","iopub.status.busy":"2026-05-12T12:14:37.215955Z","iopub.status.idle":"2026-05-12T12:14:37.411845Z","shell.execute_reply":"2026-05-12T12:14:37.411038Z"},"papermill":{"duration":0.207549,"end_time":"2026-05-12T12:14:37.418931+00:00","exception":false,"start_time":"2026-05-12T12:14:37.211382+00:00","status":"completed"},"tags":[]},"outputs":[{"data":{"application/vnd.jupyter.widget-view+json":{"model_id":"6cf690d449b244fc8f344814a527b18f","version_major":2,"version_minor":0},"text/plain":["VBox(children=(HTML(value='<h2>🛒 Logiflow Intelligence Search Bridge</h2>'), HTML(value='<p>Enter a product to…"]},"metadata":{},"output_type":"display_data"}],"source":["import pandas as pd\n","import numpy as np\n","import datetime\n","import ipywidgets as widgets\n","from IPython.display import display, HTML, clear_output\n","\n","# ==========================================\n","# 1. DATA SOURCE (High-Fidelity Public Mockup)\n","# ==========================================\n","\n","def generate_public_inventory():\n","    \"\"\"Generates a robust DataFrame mimicking real-world retail data.\"\"\"\n","    products_list = [\n","        (\"Organic Milk\", \"Dairy\"), (\"Fresh Avocado\", \"Produce\"), \n","        (\"Greek Yogurt\", \"Dairy\"), (\"Sourdough Bread\", \"Bakery\"),\n","        (\"Almond Milk\", \"Beverages\"), (\"Red Apples\", \"Produce\"),\n","        (\"Dark Chocolate\", \"Snacks\"), (\"Avocado Toast Kit\", \"Bakery\")\n","    ]\n","    stores = [\"Corner Market\", \"Green Grocer\", \"City SuperMart\", \"Local Pantry\", \"Organic Hub\"]\n","    \n","    data = []\n","    today = datetime.date.today()\n","\n","    for _ in range(60):  # Generate 60 entries\n","        p_name, p_cat = random.choice(products_list)\n","        store = random.choice(stores)\n","        dist = round(random.uniform(0.5, 12.0), 1)\n","        qty = random.randint(0, 50)\n","        price = round(random.uniform(2.5, 15.0), 2)\n","        \n","        # Expiry Date Logic: Some very soon (Zero Waste), some far away\n","        # We'll mix them: 10% chance of being < 3 days\n","        if random.random() < 0.15:\n","            expiry = today + datetime.timedelta(days=random.randint(0, 2))\n","        else:\n","            expiry = today + datetime.timedelta(days=random.randint(5, 30))\n","            \n","        data.append({\n","            \"Product\": p_name,\n","            \"Category\": p_cat,\n","            \"Store_Name\": store,\n","            \"Distance_km\": dist,\n","            \"Stock_Qty\": qty,\n","            \"Expiry_Date\": expiry,\n","            \"Price\": price\n","        })\n","    \n","    return pd.DataFrame(data)\n","\n","# Initialize the global dataset\n","public_inventory = generate_public_inventory()\n","\n","# ==========================================\n","# 2. THE AGENTIC ENGINE (Logic Layer)\n","# ==========================================\n","\n","class LogiflowAgent:\n","    def __init__(self, df):\n","        self.df = df\n","\n","    def search_and_format(self, query):\n","        # 1. SEARCH: Filter the dataframe\n","        results = self.df[self.df['Product'].str.contains(query, case=False, na=False)]\n","        \n","        if results.empty or results['Stock_Qty'].sum() == 0:\n","            return self.handle_fallback()\n","\n","        # 2. VALIDATE & TRANSFORM: Build HTML Cards\n","        html_output = \"<h3 style='color: #2c3e50;'>📍 Nearby Availability Found:</h3>\"\n","        html_output += \"<div style='display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 15px;'>\"\n","\n","        today = datetime.date.today()\n","\n","        for _, row in results.iterrows():\n","            # Skip items out of stock\n","            if row['Stock_Qty'] <= 0:\n","                continue\n","\n","            # Logic: Zero Waste Check\n","            is_zero_waste = (row['Expiry_Date'] - today).days < 3\n","            discount_price = round(row['Price'] * 0.5, 2)\n","            \n","            # Styling components\n","            badge_color = \"#27ae60\" # Green for Verified\n","            zero_waste_label = \"\"\n","            price_display = f\"${row['Price']:.2f}\"\n","            \n","            if is_zero_waste:\n","                zero_waste_label = f'<div style=\"background-color: #e74c3c; color: white; padding: 4px; border-radius: 4px; font-size: 10px; font-weight: bold; margin-top: 5px;\">🔥 LOGIFLOW ZERO WASTE DEAL - 50% OFF</div>'\n","                price_display = f'<span style=\"text-decoration: line-through; color: #7f8c8d; font-size: 12px;\">${row['Price']:.2f}</span> <span style=\"color: #e74c3c; font-weight: bold;\">${discount_price:.2f}</span>'\n","\n","            # Card HTML Construction\n","            html_output += f\"\"\"\n","            <div style=\"border: 1px solid #ddd; border-radius: 8px; padding: 15px; width: 250px; background-color: white; box-shadow: 2px 2px 10px rgba(0,0,0,0.1); font-family: sans-serif;\">\n","                <div style=\"font-size: 12px; color: {badge_color}; font-weight: bold; margin-bottom: 5px;\">✅ {row['Store_Name']} (Verified Today)</div>\n","                <div style=\"font-size: 16px; font-weight: bold; color: #2c3e50; margin-bottom: 8px;\">{row['Product']}</div>\n","                <div style=\"font-size: 13px; color: #7f8c8d; margin-bottom: 10px;\">📍 {row['Distance_km']} km 